abstract: >
  The Holistix Open Biohacking Data Project is a structured, machine-readable
  reference system covering wellness technologies, product specifications,
  claims, evidence metadata, safety records, source metadata, product-to-technology
  relationships, product digital twins, and eight public reference datasets.
  Project release v1.5.0 adds interoperability, reproducibility, and machine-readable packaging while retaining
  the existing v1.2 subject datasets.

